{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42082","headline":"题徐五教池亭 · 李中","name":"题徐五教池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多士池塘好，尘中景恐无。\n年来养鸥鹭，梦不去江湖。\n泉脉通深涧，风声起短芦。\n惊鱼跳藻荇，戏蝶上菰蒲。\n泛泛容渔艇，闲闲载酒壶。\n涨痕山雨过，翠积岸苔铺。\n花影沈波底，烟光入座隅。\n晓香怜杜若，夜浸爱[蟾]蜍。\n步逸心难厌，看吟兴不辜。\n凭君命奇笔，爲我写成图。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}